","attribute_Venue":"Park200"},{"description":"Welcome to Soho. Rock ’n’ roll is in the air and Silver Johnny is the latest sensation at the Atlantic Club. But when the club’s owner is murdered, those left behind are drawn into a brutal fight for control. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFirst performed at the Royal Court in 1995, Mojo became a defining play of a new, uncompromising era in British theatre. Slick, visceral and darkly funny, Butterworth’s landmark debut crackles with energy and ambition. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mojo","instanceDates":"4 March-10 April","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"https://parktheatre.co.uk/events/mojo/","webEventId":null,"id":"142401APTVNLQVQRLKMQNBSHQLSMKJDJL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-04T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-04T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-10T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-10T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeSuitability":"16+","attribute_ExcludeFromDonationSlider":false,"attribute_Genre":"Drama","attribute_HasInterval":true,"attribute_Interval":"20mins","attribute_RecommendationCategory1":"Drama","attribute_RecommendationCategory2":"New writing","attribute_RunningTime":"2hrs 20mins","attribute_Season":"Park Main Season","attribute_Venue":"Park200","attribute_RecommendationCategory3":""},{"description":"Simply select your preferred seat by clicking on the seating plan below. The coloured bands indicate the two prices of £600 or £800. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":1,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Name a Seat","instanceDates":"31 December-31 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":"nameaseat","id":"13801AGMJPLQGHBSJHBGMRNCQQKGVHKBV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2099-12-31T00:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2099-12-31T00:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2099-12-31T00:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2099-12-31T00:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ExcludeFromDonationSlider":tr